    "text": {
      "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox vevent\" cellspacing=\"5\" style=\"width:22em; text-align:left; font-size:88%; line-height:1.5em; font-size: 90%\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"summary\" style=\"text-align:center; text-align:center; font-size:125%; font-weight:bold; font-size: 110%; font-style: italic\">Potion Maker - 포션 메이커 (<i>Posyeon Meikeo</i>)</th></tr><tr class=\"\"><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><audio src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/4/42/Main_Theme.ogg/revision/latest?cb=20150603013742\" width=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 180px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://potionmaker.fandom.com/wiki/File:Main_Theme.ogg\">https://potionmaker.fandom.com/wiki/File:Main_Theme.ogg</a></audio></span><hr /><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/5/55/PotionMakerGooglePlayBanner.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150527232624\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"PotionMakerGooglePlayBanner\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"146\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"PotionMakerGooglePlayBanner.jpg\" data-image-key=\"PotionMakerGooglePlayBanner.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/5/55/PotionMakerGooglePlayBanner.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20150527232624\" /></a></span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 95%; line-height: 1.5em\">Potion maker's Google Play Banner</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; white-space: nowrap\">Developer</th>\n    <td class=\"\" style=\"\">\n<a href=\"/wiki/Sinsiroad\" title=\"Sinsiroad\">Sinsiroad</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; white-space: nowrap\">Designer</th>\n    <td class=\"\" style=\"\">\nKutata</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; white-space: nowrap\">Programmer</th>\n    <td class=\"\" style=\"\">\nHalak</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; white-space: nowrap\">Artist</th>\n    <td class=\"\" style=\"\">\nKutata, Mauve</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; white-space: nowrap\">Composer</th>\n    <td class=\"\" style=\"\">\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://dova-s.jp/\">DOVA-SYNDROME</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; white-space: nowrap\">Release date</th>\n    <td class=\"\" style=\"\">\n2015</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left; white-space: nowrap\">Genre</th>\n    <td class=\"\" style=\"\">\nIdle mobile game</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Potion Maker</b> is an idle mobile game app developed by <a href=\"/wiki/Sinsiroad\" title=\"Sinsiroad\">Sinsiroad</a>. Potion Maker is sinsiroad's first <sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> game. \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Story\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Story</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Gameplay\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Story\">Story</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPotion_Maker%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\">Pio</a>, the protagonist of the game, resides in a small potion shop located presumably in the outskirts of her kingdom. There she is visited by wandering <a href=\"/wiki/Travelers\" title=\"Travelers\">travelers</a> who often come with orders or ask for her potions. In return, they agree to do requests for her. One night while the shop has closed, <a href=\"/wiki/Tia\" title=\"Tia\">Tia</a> visits and informs everyone that she has been sent from the Kingdom.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Pio then remembers that the letter she received about help coming must have been about Tia, since she had dropped the letter in the cauldron before she could read it. Tia then unpacks her things and begins assisting Pio with her potion shop.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay\">Gameplay</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPotion_Maker%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The player is tasked with creating <a href=\"/wiki/Potion\" title=\"Potion\">potions</a> with the highest value they can, and then selling them. Dropping ingredients into the cauldron will increment the potion's value. Enhancing the potion will multiply its value, but has a chance of failing. Failed enhancements will destroy the potion unless it is protected by a enhancement failure protection powerup. Travelers may come to the player with quests, which, if fulfilled, grant <a href=\"/wiki/Powerup\" title=\"Powerup\">powerup</a> items to help brew potions. Upgrades may also be purchased for coins gained from potions, which allow players to upgrade their materials to make higher-grade potions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPotion_Maker%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"d63e0b3bd38dad8e3636aed38f0e7ac3\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Splash-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:104px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Splash.png\" title=\"Splash.png (1.1 MB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:104px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/0/01/Splash.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/104?cb=20150528042344\" title=\"Splash.png (1.1 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Current splash screen\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Splash.png\" data-image-key=\"Splash.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Current splash screen\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Splash.png (1.1 MB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Current splash screen\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Splash.png\" data-image-key=\"Splash.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Current splash screen\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/0/01/Splash.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/104?cb=20150528042344\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Current splash screen</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery